The core architecture
The strongest version is a four-layer system:
1. Grammar / Type System   Defines legal states, fields, actions, transitions, validators, and invariants.2. ML Scorer   Converts messy context into typed numerical fields.3. Deterministic State Machine   Uses grammar rules and scores to classify state, choose legal transitions,   detect singularities, and update graph position.4. Distribution Layer   Maintains probabilities over states, actions, strata, and failure modes.
So the model does measurement, not unconstrained control.
That is the important design discipline.
Example
