JSON{  "task_state": "verify",  "evidence_strength": 0.72,  "contradiction_pressure": 0.31,  "answer_readiness": 0.64,  "search_value": 0.58,  "loop_pressure": 0.12,  "uncertainty": 0.21}
The grammar says:
